# 📝 Personal Docs, Local Notes & Logs
**/*.docx
**/*.doc
**/*.xlsx
**/*.pdf
**/*.log
flutter_*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.bak
**/*.local
**/*.private
